title: "JevOss: Open Evaluation Toolkit for Jev-Type Decision Models"
abstract: "Probes, calibration and recipes for any decision model that speaks the Jev API: accuracy, honest probabilities, and where the model breaks under hidden instructions, shuffled options, padding, negations and repeated calls."
